  DisplayName: Deep-Sea Diver
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: The sapphire depths of the seas and the mysteries they hold beneath
    their surface have always piqued your interest. Your obsession with the ocean
    depths cannot be contained to one world alone, and you've read tomes and journals
    about the source of all water, everywhere, hoping to one day understand the watery
    secrets of the great unknown. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Strength
    or Wisdom , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Athletics
    skill and the Plane of Water Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Underwater
    Marauder] skill feat.
